{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/mira.png?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eternal Circus is a top-down dodge'm up where you can become a nimble mech fighting bosses while dodging barrage of missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OUTMANEUVERING MISSILES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/final-outmaneuver.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mech can move and dash to avoid missiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EC DRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/ec1.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the pink EC meter is full, the player can engage the EC Drive. Time slows down considerably, so you have a second to breathe and think out your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAIN ENERGY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/dodge3.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodging enemy projectiles in EC Drive gives you Energy, which is required to attack the boss. The closer you get to missiles and other enemies, the more Energy you get, so riskier plays are rewarded with more Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MELEE ATTACK YOUR FOE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/attack1_1.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you have enough energy, approach your target to lock on and perform a melee attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THREE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/bosses.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss has unique attack patterns. Are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck out there o7</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422310?t=1748376766","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/f5c6ee9f31d3fe51089416469d689064fa25ca8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748376766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/3cd7bfbbed7b80922ec667d3d6aeb0fd847d4da1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748376766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/3cd7bfbbed7b80922ec667d3d6aeb0fd847d4da1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748376766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/mira.png?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eternal Circus is a top-down dodge'm up where you can become a nimble mech fighting bosses while dodging barrage of missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OUTMANEUVERING MISSILES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/final-outmaneuver.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mech can move and dash to avoid missiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EC DRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/ec1.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the pink EC meter is full, the player can engage the EC Drive. Time slows down considerably, so you have a second to breathe and think out your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAIN ENERGY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/dodge3.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodging enemy projectiles in EC Drive gives you Energy, which is required to attack the boss. The closer you get to missiles and other enemies, the more Energy you get, so riskier plays are rewarded with more Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MELEE ATTACK YOUR FOE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/attack1_1.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you have enough energy, approach your target to lock on and perform a melee attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THREE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/bosses.gif?t=1748376766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss has unique attack patterns. Are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck out there o7</p>","developers":["Team Eternal Circus"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/031856ae3a448824e0ff7d0e10bd795cdcda3a29/header.jpg?t=1748376766","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134154,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134154/movie480.mp4?t=1748376462","max":"http: